# Build context is the repo root for all JS app images. Keep it lean.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
.git
.git-backups
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/__pycache__
*.tsbuildinfo

# SylibOS regenerable data + Python venv. Gigabytes of OCW content and build
# output, gitignored, copied into NO image — but the root build context is the
# repo root, so every service build was taring + shipping these to the daemon.
# This was the dominant build-time cost (context: ~2.6 GB → ~3 MB).
apps/sylibos/Courses
apps/sylibos/ProcessedCourses
**/.venv
